{"overview":{"Symbol":"AIIOW","Name":"Robo.ai Inc.","Description":"Robo.ai Inc., a smart passenger vehicle company, provides passenger-centric mobility and green energy solutions in the United States, the United Arab Emirates, and Mainland China. It develops electric vehicles, including MUSE, GHIATH, and autonomous logistics vehicles; and Astra that offers intelligent logistics, automatic delivery, and shared travel solutions. The company is also involved in the wholesale and retail of vehicles; and sale of auto parts and materials. In addition, it provides business management, operations, commercialization, and warranty, as well as design and technology development services. The company was formerly known as NWTN, Inc. and changed its name to Robo.ai Inc. in August 2025. Robo.ai Inc. is headquartered in Dubai, the United Arab Emirates.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqCM","Currency":"USD","Country":"United Arab Emirates","Sector":"","Industry":"","Address":"Meydan Grandstand, Dubai, United Arab Emirates","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"","EBITDA":"-156854000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"-6.031","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"","RevenuePerShareTTM":"0.06","ProfitMargin":"0","OperatingMarginTTM":"-1758.0814","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-3.94601","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"","RevenueTTM":"950000","GrossProfitTTM":"151000","DilutedEPSTTM":"","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"-0.982","AnalystTargetPrice":"","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"","PriceToBookRatio":"","EVToRevenue":"","EVToEBITDA":"","Beta":"2.152","52WeekHigh":"0.0518","52WeekLow":"0.0453","50DayMovingAverage":"","200DayMovingAverage":"","SharesOutstanding":"","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":""},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"AIIOW","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-06-11","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{